        (newKlongs_times c.i first) hpt8 hwfN (klongsWf_newKlongs c.i first) key
      · simp only [wNode, h8tc m1 (Ne.symm hlm1) (Ne.symm hrm1), hm1T, Bool.false_eq_true, ↓reduceIte]
